 ],
 "notes": "Proposed policy: decade-driver membership required; exact year lists optional. 2000s=2000–2009, 2010s=2010–2019, 2020s=2020–2029 within corpus coverage. A driver can belong to several decades. Corpus explicitly gives Verstappen 2021–2024; do not interpret old open-ended 2021– as future championships."
}
